  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Psalms",
    "delineation": "Psalm",
    "number": 102,
    "summary": "The psalmist offers a prayer of the afflicted—Zion will be built up when the Lord appears in His glory—Though the heaven and earth perish, the Lord who created them will endure forever.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "Hear my prayer, O Lord, and let my cry come unto thee.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 1,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 102:1",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 102,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Hide not thy face from me in the day when I am in trouble; incline thine ear unto me: in the day when I call answer me speedily.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 4,
            "text": "D&C 121:1 (1–8)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 37,
            "end": 41
          },
          {
            "start": 97,
            "end": 101
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 102:2",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 102,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "For my days are consumed like smoke, and my bones are burned as an hearth.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 102:3",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 102,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "My heart is smitten, and withered like grass; so that I forget to eat my bread.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 102:4",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 102,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "By reason of the voice of my groaning my bones cleave to my skin.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 102:5",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 102,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "I am like a pelican of the wilderness: I am like an owl of the desert.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 12,
            "end": 19,
            "text": "HEB vulture, hawk."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 102:6",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 102,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "I watch, and am as a sparrow alone upon the house top.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 102:7",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 102,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "Mine enemies reproach me all the day; and they that are mad against me are sworn against me.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 38,
            "end": 41
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 102:8",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 102,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "For I have eaten ashes like bread, and mingled my drink with weeping,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 102:9",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 102,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "Because of thine indignation and thy wrath: for thou hast lifted me up, and cast me down.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 102:10",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 102,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "My days are like a shadow that declineth; and I am withered like grass.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 19,
            "end": 25,
            "text": "1 Chr. 29:15; Ps. 144:4."
          },
          {
            "start": 65,
            "end": 70,
            "text": "Isa. 40:6 (6–8)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 8,
            "end": 11
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [
