        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 102:18",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 102,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "For he hath looked down from the height of his sanctuary; from heaven did the Lord behold the earth;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 19,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 102:19",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 102,
        "verse": 19
      },
      {
        "text": "To hear the groaning of the prisoner; to loose those that are appointed to death;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 20,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 102:20",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 102,
        "verse": 20
      },
      {
        "text": "To declare the name of the Lord in Zion, and his praise in Jerusalem;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 21,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 102:21",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 102,
        "verse": 21
      },
      {
        "text": "When the people are gathered together, and the kingdoms, to serve the Lord.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 22,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 102:22",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 102,
        "verse": 22
      },
      {
        "text": "He weakened my strength in the way; he shortened my days.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
